#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcast-telemetry.rst:5
#: 6854d10463ee438dae595df4df623389
msgid "UAVcast 3G/4G Cellular Telemetry"
msgstr "UAVcast 3G/4G 蜂窝数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcast-telemetry.rst:11
#: 375dddb65a4441788afe8849472e622a
msgid ""
"`UAVcast <http://uavmatrix.com>`__ allows the transmission of MAVLink "
"telemetry via the 3G/4G cellular network over nearly unlimited distances."
msgstr ""
"`UAVcast <http://uavmatrix.com>`__ 允许通过 3G/4G 蜂窝网络传输 MAVLink 数传，传输距离几乎不受限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcast-telemetry.rst:14
#: e5ff5a8265b04dd79df26e5be4dac0af
msgid ""
"Since most cellular coverage is directed to cover only 200-300 feet AGL, "
"except in metropolitan areas with high rise buildings, flight "
"(ArduPlane/ArduCopter) applications may experience coverage issues at higher"
" vehicle altitudes."
msgstr ""
"由于大多数蜂窝网络覆盖仅针对地面以上 200-300 "
"英尺以内（在高层建筑较多的都市区除外），飞行（ArduPlane/ArduCopter）应用在较高飞行高度可能会遇到覆盖问题。"
